 "title": "[stacks-project]",
 "statement": "The constructed maps $\\Phi_{\\mathcal I,\\mathcal J}$ and\n$\\Psi_{\\mathcal I,\\mathcal J}$ are inverse over $X$. Thus the iterated\nblow-up is identified with the blow-up of $\\mathcal I\\mathcal J$.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-lem-nagata-sketch-blowups/thm-nagata-blowup-product-ideal.md",
  "place": "node thm-nagata-blowup-product-ideal, order 123"
 },
